body:
Got carried away by its &#39;Apple Design Award&#39; and other jactitations and ended up making the purchase. Totally missed this glaring disclaimer. They&#39;re calling it - &#34;Six tasks: Stay focused, get them done.&#34; What if I have more than 6 to stay focused on? &#34;Uh...No can do mister!&#34;

Do not get carried away by the Health app and Apple Watch integration. These functionalities may be useful,
but not when the base app itself is a rip-off that severely limits your choice. Complete waste of ₹250! I am sure the devs didn&#39;t intend this, but I honestly felt cheated.
